{"about_the_game":"Return to the classic days of platforming with <i>Destroy Space Aliens</i>! The Legendary Sir Frank Jones V has mysteriously vanished leaving you in charge to watch over his castle. On your way there you discover it is overrun with invading Space Aliens! Master both the sword and blaster to overthrow your enemies as they try to surprise and outwit you using the environment to their advantage. Will your skills be enough to retake the throne or will you need something more to destroy the Space Aliens once and for all?<br><br><u>NEW Item Randomizer:</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Available on Steam's Beta Branch [itemrandomizer]<br></li><li>Play through the Metroidvania section of the game with randomized item locations<br></li><li>Item locations are determined by the seed that you enter when starting the game so you can play the same randomization multiple times</li></ul><br><u>Key Features:</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic 2D platforming<br></li><li>10+ challenging boss fights<br></li><li>Designed for speedrunning and sequence breaking<br></li><li>No RNG<br></li><li>Original soundtrack<br></li><li>4 Colors<br></li><li>Password system<br></li><li>3 different endings depending on in game actions</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"c8eb75cf63f495ca2810621650137ab25bb58bf5.jpg","localized_name":"First Encounter","name":"First Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/733180/c8eb75cf63f495ca2810621650137ab25bb58bf5.jpg"},{"icon":"1f707a077c8ee77844aec5ed383661e3e9b30981.jpg","localized_name":"Beat Library","name":"Beat Library","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/733180/1f707a077c8ee77844aec5ed383661e3e9b30981.jpg"},{"icon":"c72c057658edd3f433e549fe7d67a4d6b818a3aa.jpg","localized_name":"Beat Watchtower","name":"Beat Watchtower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/733180/c72c057658edd3f433e549fe7d67a4d6b818